  "regrow.intro": "Tīmata i te māra tūturu i ngā kai e pānui ana e kore e hāngai. Ko te kowhiri i raro nāna i mōhio ki te pono — kāore he pātaru Pinterest, anake ngā tikanga e puta ana hei kai.",
