  "cut.notes": "Tuhinga pono",
  "cut.detail.heading": "Hei putunga puāwaitanga",
  "cut.empty": "Kaore he puāwaitanga e hāngai ana ki tēnei tūnga.",
  "regrow.pin_to_pinterest": "Tiakina i runga i a Pinterest",
  "regrow.pin_description": "Tīreia mai i ngā Pā hanga — ngā wāhanga pono e pā ana ki ngā tikanga mai i Patch & Pot. Tīmatahia he kāinga tūturu mai i ngā pā hanga rōpere.",
  "cut.pin_to_pinterest": "Tiakina i runga i a Pinterest",
  "cut.pin_description": "Tāehia ngā Māra — whakaarohia e Patch & Pot. He pono te pāroa mau, te taumata tika ki te tā, me te mea hei whakauru kia mau ngā māra mō te wā roa.",
  "cut.tips.eyebrow": "Me waiho ngā māra mō te wā roa",
  "cut.tips.title": "He aha hei whakauru ki tō pāroa (me ngā mea hei whakakore)",
  "cut.tips.intro": "He tino pūtaiao kei te pupuri i ngā māra tāehia ki te ora — te huka hei whāngai i te puawai, he waikura māmā hei pupuri i te wai e teiki ana i te peka, me te iti o te bleach hei aukati i ngā kuku e pū mai ana. Tāpirihia ngā peni, vodka me te pūhā hiiko ka kite koe i runga i a Pinterest — kāore he mea e whai wāhi ana ki ngā mea kei tō rātaka.",
  "cut.tips.vase_food.title": "Whakawhanakehia tō ake kai māra",
  "cut.tips.vase_food.body": "I te whāngai 1 litre o te wai kōtahi: 1 tsp huka (kai), 1 tsp te vineka ma (waikura, āwhina i ngā peka ki te inu), me ¼ tsp bleach kāinga (patua ngā kuku e pū mai ana i ngā peka). He pai ake i te nuinga o ngā tāpoke, kāore hoki e utu.",
  "cut.tips.rewater.title": "Whakawhānauhia ia 2 rā",
  "cut.tips.rewater.body": "Waiho te pāroa, horoia atu ngā paru, ā, whakakīhia ki te wai kai hou. Ko te wai mīharo he kuku — ā, ko te kuku te tino take nui e pā ana ki te ngaro o ngā māra i te wā tuatahi.",
  "cut.tips.trim_stems.title": "Tā e ngā peka i te kokonga",
  "cut.tips.trim_stems.body": "Tā 1–2 cm i raro i te kokonga 45° i raro i te wai e teiki ana i mua i te whakaurunga ki te pāroa, ā, anō ki ia whakakī. Ko te kokonga e tuku ana i te wāhi atu hei inu, ā, ka noho ana ngā tā e noho ana i raro i te wai hei aukati i ngā pūkete hau e pū mai ana i te peka.",
  "cut.tips.strip_leaves.title": "Kohia ngā rau i raro i te wai",
  "cut.tips.strip_leaves.body": "Ka ngā rau e muru ana, ka pupuhi te wai ki te supa kuku i roto i te rā kotahi. Tangohia ngā mea katoa i te tīwae raro o te peka — ahakoa kāore e rite ki te riri.",
  "cut.tips.cool_spot.title": "Pūrei ki te nui o te pōuri",
  "cut.tips.cool_spot.body": "I waho i te ra, i te taha ke o ngā pāhotanga me te tepu TV. Ka penapena ngā kaiwhakarato putiputi i ngā putiputi i te 2–5 °C i te pō; ka taea e koe te whakakākahu i tēnei mā te neke i te puawai ki tētahi hōhanga maūroa, ki tētahi pōti i mua i te moenga.",
  "cut.tips.no_fruit.title": "I waho i te rīhi hua",
  "cut.tips.no_fruit.body": "Ko ngā hua e pōuri ana (nāna i ngā panana, āporo, tōmatomato) ka tuku i te ethylene — he hau e tohu ana ki ngā pua ki te pakeke. Ka taea e te puawai e te taha o te rīhi hua te mate ki te haurua o te wā.",
  "cut.tips.spring_cold.title": "Ka pā ana ngā taratara ki te wai mātao",
  "cut.tips.spring_cold.body": "Ka noho te wātea mō te hōngongoi, kākaurā, hiacinthe me te ranunculus mō te wā roa i te wai mātao — ā, ka haere pea te tākarakōkiri i roto i te puawai, nō reira waiho he wāhi mō rātou ki te whakarei 5–10 cm teitei.",
  "cut.tips.clean_vase.title": "Tīmatahia me te puawai pātea",
  "cut.tips.clean_vase.body": "Pūrei te puawai i te wai pihanga pātea (i runga i te painga o te whakawhitinga o te kiri) i mua i ia whakaritenga. Ko te kiri o ngā pūtau i te wiki e haere ake nei, kāore e taea te kite — ā, ka haurua te ora o ngā tauira hou.",
  "cut.tips.footnote": "Kotahi te whakamōhio: ka rua ngā kokonga o ngā taratara me ngā narcissus i te sap e pā kino ana ki ētahi atu putiputi. Tuia rātau i a rātou anō mō te 6 haora i te wai hou i mua i te taapiri ki te whakahouta, ā, kaua e whakatika anō i te wā e pā ana.",
  "source.local.title": "Hoko i te rohe tuatahi",
  "source.local.body": "Ko ngā tipu pai kei te nāna mai i tētahi pokapū tūturu, ā, ko te trowel pai kei te nāna mai i te hoko rino tawhito e te ara — ngā tāngata e mōhio ana i tā rātou taonga ka taea te tuku tohutohu. Whakawātea tuatahi i te rohe, mō te tipu me te taputapu. Ka pupuri i te noho o ngā kaipuhitahi iti me ngā toa hoko iti.",
  "source.local.cta": "Kimihia ngā pokanga i te taha o au",
  "legal.terms.affiliates.html": "<p>Patch &amp; Pot e tautokohia ana e ngā kaipānui. Ko ngā hono i roto i tā mātou wāhanga “Mō ngā ipu, taputapu &amp; kompo” i runga i ngā whārangi plant he hono kāhui Amazon — i te wā e pā ai koe, e hoko ai, ka taea e mātou te riro i tētahi kāinga iti kāore e utua e koe. E awhina ana ēnei kāinga ki te pupuri i te pae e rere ana me te kore utu mō ngā kaipānui e pā ana.</p><p><em>Hei Kāore Amazon, ka riro mai i a Patch &amp; Pot te utu e tika ana</em> i runga i Amazon.co.uk me Amazon.com.</p><p>Kāore mātou e whai wāhi ki tētahi atu kāhui kāinga. Kāore mātou e hono ki ngā pākaha plant mō te kāinga — engari, ka tūtohu mātou i tētahi mapi ora o ngā pokapū kari me ngā pākaha i te taha o te kaipānui, kāore hoki e whakangao atu.</p>",
  "source.tools.blurb": "Mō ngā ipu, kompo, pūtau kikī, kōmaka me ērā atu taputapu — he mea whai a Amazon mēnā kāore te kōwhiringa o te rohe e tika ana. Kāore he pokanga tipu; whakamahia te mapi o te rohe i runga mō te tipu anake.",
  "source.local.tools_cta": "Kimihia ngā kōhatu rino i te taha o au",
