  "plants.grow_where.heading": "Ka taea e au te tipu i tēnei i hea?",
  "plants.grow_where.subheading": "Ngā āhuatanga e taea ai te tipu nei — mai i te paepae kitchini a te tangata ki te tihi pūhiko e pāwhāia ana e te hau.",
  "grow.eyebrow": "Tipu ki hewa",
  "grow.title": "Tipu Ki Hewa",
  "grow.intro": " kāore e hiahiatia he māra ki te tipu i tētahi mea e tika ana hei kai, hei tirohanga rānei. Tīpicka he āhuatanga kei a koe — he matapihi pūmau i te tari, he pūtara pātea, he kérea pākākā i te pātaka, he rōrahi pātea — ā, ka whakaaturia e mātou ngā tipu katoa i te whare pukapuka e tipu ana i reira.",
