  "grow.situation.windowsill.label": "Pātū kapua",
  "grow.situation.windowsill.blurb": "Rawa te marama i roto, ngongo iti, kāore e taea te tuku ki waho — te pātū kuīni kākahu.",
  "grow.situation.workplace.label": "Te teepu mahi",
  "grow.situation.workplace.blurb": "Kōwae tari, te marama pātea, e āta noho ana i ngā mutunga wiki.",
  "grow.situation.balcony.label": "Balkoni",
  "grow.situation.balcony.blurb": "Tētahi miihini i runga i te pupuni i waho — ētahi rā, ētahi hau.",
  "grow.situation.rooftop.label": "Pū runga",
  "grow.situation.rooftop.blurb": "Te rā katoa, whakarite i te raumati, he haurangi — kōwhiria ngā tipu kaha, e kākahu ana ki te kore wai.",
  "grow.situation.shady-corner.label": "Wahi pātea",
  "grow.situation.shady-corner.blurb": "He rāngai e tahaki ana ki te raki, i raro i te rākau, i te taha o te whare.",
  "grow.situation.hanging-basket.label": "Ika rīwai tuuru",
  "grow.situation.hanging-basket.blurb": "Ngā tipu e tarai ana ki runga — he pātea, he māmā ki te kōhuwai, e hiahia ana ki te hautūtanga.",
  "grow.situation.wall-crevice.label": "Kōpaki paretū",
  "grow.situation.wall-crevice.blurb": "He pokanga raakau kore, he pereki e rūkahu ana — he iti ngā pātea, he nui te pāhi.",
  "grow.situation.vertical-wall.label": "Kōpaki pere tūranga",
  "grow.situation.vertical-wall.blurb": "Ngā pātea o te pāti kōhatu, he papatū o ngā rākau — he pātea māmā anake.",
  "grow.situation.grow-bag.label": "Pōtaka māra",
  "grow.situation.grow-bag.blurb": "He pōtaka tūmau iti, 20–40 L — ka tino mōhio ngā hua e hiahia ana ki ēnei.",
  "grow.situation.bucket.label": "Pūtara whakamahia anō",
  "grow.situation.bucket.blurb": "He pūtara 10–20 L i whakaora, me ngā kōwhiringa pāhere — he pōtae whaihua mō te utu iti.",
  "grow.situation.crate.label": "Kareti raka",
  "grow.situation.crate.blurb": "He kareti waina kōhatu, he rārangi me te hessian — he tino pai mō te rākau karoti me ngā rākau kiwi tuhinga.",
  "grow.situation.raised-bed.label": "Pātea teitei",
  "grow.situation.raised-bed.blurb": "He pātea tikanga, he pā tīma-tūtohu — te rahi o ngā pakiaka, te whiriwhiri rahi o ngā tipu.",
  "grow.situation.water-jar.label": "Ipukarea wai",
  "grow.situation.water-jar.blurb": "He ipukarea jam o te wai kei te papa — kāore he oneone. Ka whakaora mai i ngā rāpihi o te kīhini.",
  "grow.empty": "Kāore he tipu e taea te whakakotahi ki tēnei wāhi.",
  "grow.explore_all": "Tūhura i te whare tipu",
  "grow.cta.title": "Tipu i He Wahi",
  "grow.cta.blurb": "Kāore he māra? He papa rāhui, he poka pātea, he pēke paukū, e tipu ana. Kimihia ngā tipu e ora ana i te wāhi e pā ana ki a koe.",
  "grow.cta.button": "Kimihia ngā tipu mō tō wāhi",
  "recipe.eyebrow": "He take tika ki te whakatipu",
  "recipe.title": "Recipes",
  "recipe.intro": "Ko ngā rīpene e pā ana ki te kāinga e whakamahi ana i ngā mea ka taea e koe te whakatipu i te kāinga — ngā rongoā mō te nui, ngā kai i te panui mai i te kaupapa, me ngā whakapainga e kawe ana i te raumati ki te takurua. Tīpakohia e pā ana ki te mea kei te wā ka whakamahia, ā, ko ngā mea e wātea ana i tō kari.",
