  "recipe.empty": "Kāore he rīpene i te kitea e pā ana ki tēnei tīpako. Tūhurahia te rīpene kai, ko te huri ki \"Katoa ngā rīpene\".",
  "recipe.section.preserves": "Ngā whakapainga mō te Takurua",
  "recipe.section.preserves_blurb": "Patahia te raumati i te wā e tino utu ana. Ko ia jar i te kāpā hei take ki te whakatipu atu i te pākī — ngā kubu hinu tere, ngā chutney pono, ngā jam me ngā syrup e kawe ana i tētahi kari i te marama o Hānuere.",
