  "askpop.eyebrow": "Ngā pātai noa",
  "askpop.title": "Ētahi nā pātai e pātai ana ki a Nàdar",
  "askpop.intro": "Ngā pātai māra tūturu i pātaihia e ngā mema ki a Nàdar. Kua pātaihia tēnei i te iti rawa, e rua ngā wā — kāore he mea pātea, kāore he mea kotahi — ko ngā raru māra pono, ko ngā raru e pā ana ki te hunga e tau nei. He kāore e utu hei tirotiro, kāore he rehita.",
