  "askpop.empty_pristine": "Kāore he pātai rongonui i ēnei — kei te hanga tēnei rārangi e ngā mema. Haere mai ka pātaihia e rua ngā pātai ōrite, ka waiho hei mema ki te pātai i āu ake.",
  "askpop.empty_search": "Kāore he mea e hāngai ana ki tēnei tirohanga. Whakamātauria te whakamahi i ngā kupu pātea, kāore e taea te tirohanga ki te kite i te rārangi katoa.",
  "askpop.cta.title": "Pātaihia tō pātai ake",
  "askpop.cta.blurb": "Ka taea e ngā mema te pātai ki a Nàdar ki ngā pātai e 7 i te rā, te tuku whakaahua mō te tautuhi i ngā tipu, me te whiriwhiri i te kōrero i ngā wā e pai ai rātou.",
  "askpop.cta.button": "Kia mema",
