  "journal.eyebrow": "Tō pona Nàdar",
  "journal.title": "Tō pānui māra",
  "journal.intro": "Ngā pātai katoa i pātai koe ki a Nàdar, me te rā me te whakautu katoa — he pona whaiaro ka noho ki a koe i ngā wāhanga. Ka taea e koe te rapu i tō hē rerekē i te tau e pā ana ki te raru tuturu.",
